ed, as shares of Boeing co. (BA) dropped 4.2%, UnitedHealth Group Inc. (UNH) lost 3.4%, Intel Corp. (INTC) shed 3.3% and Caterpillar Inc. (CAT) gave up 3.0%. The most active Dow stock was Apple Inc. (AAPL), which fell 2.2%. Dow futures were down 487 points ahead of the open.\n-Tomi Kilgore;\n 1251ET\n ", "external_links": ["http://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php?v=250"], "published": "2018-04-04T03:00:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-04-04T21:56:46.001+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}